THE UNDERLYING BOOK
-------------------
The 1946 first edition of "Autobiography of a Yogi" by Paramahansa Yogananda
entered the public domain in the United States on 1 January 1975, its
copyright having never been renewed. Nothing here adds any claim to it.

THIS EDITION
------------
Everything added on top of that text -- the annotations, the footnote
research and overrides, the recorded narration in audio/, the pronunciation
lexicon, the site code, the styles and the tooling -- is dedicated to the
public domain worldwide under the

