  https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
  Full legal code: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

To the extent possible under law, the contributors have waived all copyright
and related or neighbouring rights to this work. You may copy, modify,
distribute, perform and sell it, for any purpose, commercial or not, without
asking permission and without giving credit. Attribution is welcome but is
not a condition.

CC0 rather than an attribution licence on purpose: a public-domain book
should not acquire new strings on its way to a reader.

THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
